  "description": "Yamaha reface CS virtual analog synthesizer: every parameter of its data list by parameter change, and Pull from its bulk dump.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "reface Data List (B0)",
      "notes": "MIDI data format (pages 2, 3) and data tables (pages 4) read by tools/profiles/yamaha/read-yamaha-pdf.mjs from reface_en_dl_b0.pdf (sha256 705182642a7be012570805c9686e1eac58bd2b9fa8584f91d33414929e1a85e9), https://usa.yamaha.com/files/download/other_assets/7/794817/reface_en_dl_b0.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
